"9:47:7","a":"خَبَالًۭا","t":"(in) confusion","p":"N","tr":"khabālan","f":["M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":1232,"l":2732},{"i":"9:47:8","a":"وَلَأَوْضَعُوا۟","t":"and would have been active","p":"V","tr":"wala-awḍaʿū","f":["PERF","(IV)","3MP"],"r":341,"l":3047,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["لَ","EMPH","prefix","l:EMPH"],["أَوْضَعُ","V","stem","PERF|(IV)|3MP"],["وا","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"9:47:9","a":"خِلَـٰلَكُمْ","t":"in your midst","p":"N","tr":"khilālakum","f":["M","ACC"],"r":505,"l":1012,"g":[["خِلَـٰ","N","stem","M|ACC"],["ـٰ","PRON","suffix","PRON:2MP"]]},{"i":"9:47:10","a":"يَبْغُونَكُمُ","t":"seeking (for) you","p":"V","tr":"yabghūnakumu","f":["IMPF","3MP"],"r":118,"l":425,"g":[["يَبْغُ","V","stem","IMPF|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"],["كُمُ","PRON","suffix","PRON:2MP"]]}]},{"l":15,"t":"a","c":0,"w":[{"i":"9:47:11","a":"ٱلْفِتْنَةَ","t":"dissension","p":"N","tr":"l-fit'nata","f":["F","ACC"],"r":180,"l":339,"g":[["ٱلْ","DET","prefix","Al"],["فِتْنَةَ","N","stem","F|ACC"]]},{"i":"9:47:12","a":"وَفِيكُمْ","t":"And among you (are some)","p":"P","tr":"wafīkum","l":3,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["فِي","P","stem",""],["كُمْ","PRON","suffix","PRON:2MP"]]},{"i":"9:47:13","a":"سَمَّـٰعُونَ","t":"who would have listened","p":"N","tr":"sammāʿūna","f":["MP","NOM"],"r":51,"l":1637},{"i":"9:47:14","a":"لَهُمْ ۗ","t":"to them","p":"PRON","tr":"lahum","f":["3MP"],"l":11,"g":[["لَ","P","prefix","l:P"],["هُمْ","PRON","stem","3MP"]]},{"i":"9:47:15","a":"وَٱللَّهُ","t":"And Allah","p":"PN","tr":"wal-lahu","f":["NOM"],"r":0,"l":1,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["ٱللَّهُ","PN","stem","NOM"]]},{"i":"9:47:16","a":"عَلِيمٌۢ","t":"(is) All-Knower","p":"ADJ","tr":"ʿalīmun","f":["MS","INDEF","NOM"],"r":5,"l":68},{"i":"9:47:17","a":"بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","t":"of the wrongdoers","p":"N","tr":"bil-ẓālimīna","f":["ACT","PCPL","MP","GEN"],"r":24,"l":89,"g":[["بِ","P","prefix","bi"],["ِٱ","DET","prefix","Al"],["لظَّـٰ","N","stem","ACT|PCPL|MP|GEN"]]},{"e":"٤٧","v":"9:47"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"9:41","t":"Go forth, whether light or heavy, and strive with your wealth and your lives in the cause of Allāh. That is better for you, if you only knew.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"9:42","t":"Had it been a near [i.e., easy] gain and a moderate trip, they [i.e., the hypocrites] would have followed you, but distant to them was the journey. And they will swear by Allāh, \"If we were able, we would have gone forth with you,\" destroying themselves [through false oaths], and Allāh knows that indeed they are liars.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"9:43","t":"Allāh has pardoned you, [O Muḥammad, but] why did you give them permission [to remain behind]? [You should not have] until it was evident to you who were truthful and you knew [who were] the liars.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"9:44","t":"Those who believe in Allāh and the Last Day would not ask permission of you to be excused from striving [i.e., fighting] with their wealth and their lives. And Allāh is Knowing of those who fear Him.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"9:45","t":"Only those would ask permission of you who do not believe in Allāh and the Last Day and whose hearts have doubted, and they, in their doubt, are hesitating.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"9:46","t":"And if they had intended to go forth, they would have prepared for it [some] preparation. But Allāh disliked their being sent, so He kept them back, and they were told, \"Remain [behind] with those who remain.\"","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"9:47","t":"Had they gone forth with you, they would not have increased you except in confusion, and they would have been active among you, seeking [to cause] you fitnah [i.e., chaos and dissension]. And among you are avid listeners to them. And Allāh is Knowing of the wrongdoers.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":47,"sd":null}],"juz":10,"hizb":20,"surahs":[9],"sajdah":false}